silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_09_manifest_hom_profile_concrete_anchor_5 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 09_manifest_hom_profile #5', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Manifest as Written Hom-Profile' the bare symbol Trace anchors to CitedVetRecordObject: The vet-record after citation key local-mittens-example-anchor-2026 is assigned and its source boundary is declared: this file is about Mittens, not Mittens itself. Same physical document; different Forge standing.." .
